        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ed Wood, Fernand Rivers\n- Roles: filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, director, screenwriter\n- Places: Saint-Lager\n\nFacts:\n- Fernand Rivers was born as François Large on 6 September 1879 in Saint-Lager and was a French actor, screenwriter, film producer, and director.\n- Ed Wood, whose full name was Edward Davis Wood Jr., was born on October 10, 1924 and was an American filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, and director.\n- Fernand Rivers died on 12 September 1960.\n- Ed Wood died on December 10, 1978.",
